  "title": "Deluxe Garlic Ribs",
  "description": "Delicious and easy. Takes very little time once the sauce has been put together. You can also prepare sauce in advance, freeze it and use it whenever you want to make ribs.",
  "authors": [
    "Helen"
  ],
